    <h2>Our Returns Policy</h2>
    <p>
        We want you to love your XGM Wellness products. If you're not fully
        satisfied, you may return unopened, unused items within 7 days of
        delivery for a refund or exchange.
    </p>

    <h2>How to Request a Return</h2>
    <p>
        Contact our team via the <a href="contact.html">Contact Us</a> page with
        your order number and reason for return. We'll guide you through the
        next steps.
    </p>

    <h2>Refunds</h2>
    <p>
        Once your return is received and inspected, approved refunds will be
        processed back to your original payment method within 5-10 business days.
    </p>

    <h2>Non-Returnable Items</h2>
    <p>
        For hygiene and safety reasons, opened or used skincare, beauty and
        health products cannot be returned unless faulty.
    </p>

    <h2>Faulty or Damaged Products</h2>
    <p>
        If you receive a faulty or damaged item, please contact us within 48
        hours of delivery with photos of the issue so we can resolve it quickly.
    </p>

</section>

